post_install() {
  cat <<'MSG'
==> emoticond: reports you make from picker menus can be sent to improve the
    data. nothing is sent unless you say yes: you're asked the first time you
    run `emoticond` in a terminal, or decide now with
      emoticond reports on    # or off
==> data: install emoticond-data, or run `emoticond data fetch`
MSG
}
